          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: క్రీడాకారుడు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "క్రీడాకారుడు — krīḍākāruḍu — \"a sportsman; an athlete\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ క్రీడాకారుడు దేశానికి పతకం తెచ్చాడు. ā krīḍākāruḍu dēśāniki patakaṁ teccāḍu. That sportsman won a medal for the country."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "క్రీడ, sport, + -కారుడు, one who does it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "క్రీడాకారుడు (krīḍākāruḍu) is built on Sanskrit krīḍā, \"sport, play, pastime\" (Monier-Williams), with -కారుడు, \"one who does\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
