          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "తలపడు (talapaḍu) is a native compound: tala, \"head\" (DEDR 3103), and the native verb paḍu, \"to feel, to suffer\" (DEDR 3853): to meet head to head."
